From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: talos-build <talos-build@local>
Date: Wed, 27 May 2026 16:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ARM: dts: bcm2712-rpi-5-b: disable sdio1 (microSD)

USB/NVMe boot does not need the microSD controller. Leaving sdio1 enabled
causes perpetual mmc0 SDHCI cmd timeouts on an empty slot.

config.txt sd=off is also set at image build time (patch 0013 __overrides__).
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/broadcom/bcm2712-rpi-5-b.dts
@@ -577,3 +577,7 @@
 &pcie2 {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&sdio1 {
+	status = "disabled";
+};
